      en: ["Vahi-Mägi is located in the Otepää Upland of southern Estonia.", "The elevation is composed of glacial sand and gravel.", "Geomorphologically, the hill is classified as a kame.", "The surrounding area features a mosaic relief with many lakes.", "The forest cover mainly consists of coniferous trees.", "The region is a popular destination for nature tourism."],
