      en: ["Koolimägi is located in the Haanja Upland in southeastern Estonia.", "The Haanja region is the highest area in the Baltic states.", "The hill consists of glacial clay and till material.", "The landscape was shaped by the Weichselian glaciation.", "Koolimägi is situated within Võru County.", "The surrounding landscape is famous for its numerous small lakes."],
